        "raw": "<p>Figured I might as well start this thread, since someone will. At the moment, this is only covering changes in Ch. 3 for hero creation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Backgrounds:<br />\r\n- Blank Slate has been moved to number 2, making it far more likely to be randomly rolled than before (0.03 -&gt; 0.2)<br />\r\n- Dynasty has been moved to number 18, making it far less likely to be randomly rolled than before (0.2-&gt;0.03)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Power Sources:<br />\r\n- Accident's ability Reflexive Burst has changed.<br />\r\n- Training's ability Always Be Prepared has changed. Training has gained access to Intellectual Powers.<br />\r\n- Genius's ability&nbsp;A Plan For Everything has been changed, and gives a different quality than before. It's ability Overwhelming Vision has been changed.<br />\r\n- The Multiverse has renamed it's abilities. Respond In Kind (formerly Combat Stance). Flowing Fight has been replaced with a new ability: Reality Scorned.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Archetypes:<br />\r\n- Physical Powerhouse's Frontline Fighting ability has had it's wording changed. Galvanize has had it's wording changed.<br />\r\n- Flyer's Dive and Drop ability has had it's wording changed.<br />\r\n- Elemental Manipulator's text regarding Elemental/Energy powers when taking the Archetype has been changed.<br />\r\n- Minion Maker's Construction Pylon ability has been changed.<br />\r\n- Modular's Quick Switch ability has been changed. The Destroyer ability has been changed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Red Zone Abilities:<br />\r\n- Elemental/Energy/Material's Summoned Allies has had it's wording changed.<br />\r\n- Material's Summoned Allies has had it's wording changed.<br />\r\n- Psychic's Summoned Allies has had it's wording changed.<br />\r\n- Self Control's Summoned Allies has had it's wording changed.<br />\r\n- Technological's Combustion has had it's wording changed.<br />\r\n- Information's Critical Eye has had it's wording changed.</p>",
